7.27-7.07(m, 10 H),6.88(t, J = 8.4Hz, 3 H), 6.80-6.76(m, 4 H), 5.05 (dd,
J = 5.9, 4.1 Hz, 1 H), 3.81(s, 3H), 3.74(s, 3 H), 2.85-2.66(m, 2 H),
2.22-2.10(m, 2 H); 13C NMR (100MHz, CDCl3) δ 159.7, 159.3, 152.9, 142.0,
139.1, 136.9,131.1, 130.2, 130.0, 128.885, 128.875, 128.86, 128.82,
